ods in model.py and control-1.py; preserve imports, helpers, signatures, and module settings.","Verify both arms reproduce incumbent outputs at zero gate weights and compute their distinct formulas with identical nonzero weights on fixed x and y.","Check empty, singleton, dense, and right-aligned histories; finite outputs and gradients; future-token perturbation invariance; zero padding gradients; and batch independence.","After a synthetic parameter update, verify the forward and score_candidates identities against encode_sequence.","Audit independent per-category initialization and the frozen execution manifest."],"expected_primary_and_slice_effects":"The falsifiable development prediction is seed-42 unweighted four-category mean HR@10 strictly above 0.60025, exceeding the observed incumbent mean 0.59525 by more than 0.005, and strictly above the generated control. Report each category effect and available history-length slices with counts; no slice benefit is established in advance.","falsification_condition":"Reject implementation admission if formulas, causality, masking, or scoring contracts fail. Reject development advancement if candidate mean HR@10 is at most 0.60025, does not exceed the generated control, or fails host eligibility. If it qualifies, apply the frozen confirmation procedure. A ranking gain alone does not establish the proposed mechanism.","gap_ids":["amazon-next-v9-round-13-residual-conditioning"],"guardrails":["Paths are relative to model/: model.py and control-1.py.","Preserve 200 epochs, 200 batches, evaluation every 5 epochs, patience 20, stable pairwise BPR, evaluation seed 20260923, 1000 users, positive plus 99 unique negatives, public-validation-only checkpoint selection, and unweighted four-category HR@10.","Reserve for four development fits per new arm, conditional confirmation fits for both arms, missing incumbent confirmation fits, and overhead; establish affordability without shortening the protocol.","Fix the architecture and 0.1